{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0273_1000_p", "source_sha256": "1fabe7fddf63147052447ec89bbb140ce1c6c72483060bf809e3821becba3243", "ja": "（クリスマス特番の収録は、無事に終わった。\n何度も乱入してきた亜美と真美には驚いたが……）", "zh": "（圣诞特别节目的录制顺利结束了。虽然亚美和真美好几次闯进来，着实吓了我一跳……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0273_1001_011ami", "source_sha256": "dd914b69b229488aab78aca46c5a792c36fd9a6021950ecf33f98e38ee20d305", "ja": "ねえねえ、兄ちゃん！\n亜美たちのカツライス、どうだった？", "zh": "呐呐，哥哥！\n我们做的炸猪排饭，味道怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0273_1002_p", "source_sha256": "28e94c740ca5ab47442bccf20029822d3ce1275ae3e2931ebb1ffa16da7ba7d7", "ja": "カツ……ああ、サプライズな。\nどうだったって、そりゃビックリしたよ。", "zh": "炸猪排……啊，是惊喜啊。\n你问怎么样，当然吓了一跳啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0273_1003_p", "source_sha256": "eb18d419a3d4d8bd8e5901ff34c3e5672f07adf1ba00509018b53a2f69e5d547", "ja": "いつの間にかサンタの衣装を着てるわ、\n出演予定じゃないコーナーに乱入するわ……。", "zh": "不知什么时候换上了圣诞装，\n还乱入到原本没有预定出演的环节……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0273_1004_011ami", "source_sha256": "7dabca4c1b7a1ac92c9c41400bbfb91b08a81849dbcd12e661fba6adfaeab224", "ja": "んっふっふ～♪　今日のサフランライスは、\n真美とメンツユな打ち合わせをしてたからね～！", "zh": "嗯呼呼～♪今天的藏红花饭，可是因为和真美进行了周密的商量呢～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0273_1005_p", "source_sha256": "836e2cdda4a4b5b2148c3e074980524f53b5a49ef48e46acd9270d18e4626cb8", "ja": "さっきから腹でも減ってるのか……？\nって、最初から乱入する気でいたのか！？", "zh": "从刚才开始就饿肚子了吗……？  \n等等，你从一开始就打算乱入的吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0273_1006_011ami", "source_sha256": "6ea2d68e11cda589a87ef872501d3378d5cfbb94016b4d29a0b36854c356cb9f", "ja": "うん！　クリスマス特番だし、真美とビッグな\nイタズラ仕掛けたいねー♪って話してたんだよね！", "zh": "嗯！毕竟是圣诞特别节目嘛，我们刚才还在商量要和真美一起搞个大大的恶作剧呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0273_1007_011ami", "source_sha256": "918db032bca064b072098f3129a56ba122f55b6c4545355e1e8ae5d04e7c644e", "ja": "でも、ファンの兄ちゃんや姉ちゃんたちも楽しそう\nだったし、それに……兄ちゃんも、楽しかったっしょ？", "zh": "不过，粉丝哥哥姐姐们看起来也玩得很开心，而且……哥哥你也玩得很开心吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0273_1008_p", "source_sha256": "094af40e281bc6642db49bf45431856e322d242706edbc064a654bf9a6b68e73", "ja": "う、う～ん。そうだな……。予定にない行動で\nドタバタもしたけど……。", "zh": "嗯、嗯～……是啊……虽然因为计划外的行动闹得手忙脚乱……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0273_1009_p", "source_sha256": "fa61cf9df5ec083f3b89a7808c20d3f1bb78a7e19013a47eae5443813a8f10f8", "ja": "でも、結果的に番組も大盛り上がりだったし、\n楽しめたといえば、楽しめた……のか？", "zh": "不过，结果节目也变得热闹非凡，\n要说玩得开心，确实也算开心了……吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0273_1010_011ami", "source_sha256": "f3da30973cfb8e683a62524e2cd5e7e12d07b86c637aacc6149ff14dd974b770", "ja": "やった～☆　んじゃ、亜美たちからの\nプレゼント大作戦は、大成功ってワケだね♪", "zh": "成功啦～☆　这么说，亚美这边的礼物大作战，就是大成功咯♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0273_1011_p", "source_sha256": "828bf59f3593399aa363ffb723bc14680aea3a00f6b9e8e826071ff6a461ceea", "ja": "は？　プレゼント？", "zh": "啊？礼物？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0273_1012_011ami", "source_sha256": "fb9a98d3f12b601a39d2f5cbbfc48be85b9d191dcf2f05f263c08f8e4b7d2d09", "ja": "そうそう！　今日のイタズラはね、みんなに\n今年一年のお礼を伝える、プレゼントだったんだ！", "zh": "对对！今天的恶作剧啊，其实是向大家表达这一年来的感谢的礼物！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0273_1013_011ami", "source_sha256": "5cfe3427b296bd58e61f83b2fc9a59c3bcbb10a61383874c1e31246cb8fec98a", "ja": "今年一年、たくさんイタズラに引っかかってくれて\nありがと！って感謝と……。", "zh": "这一年里，谢谢大家被我们捉弄了那么多次！这是感谢，还有……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0273_1014_011ami", "source_sha256": "396caad4d0dcb40e84921753a14aeed96fd988d0d287fe18b6f7271be522c0ef", "ja": "来年も、亜美たちからのイタズラに期待しててね！\nっていう、ダブルフィリングなのだ！", "zh": "明年也要期待亚美她们的恶作剧哦！这就是所谓的双重馅料啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0273_1015_p", "source_sha256": "c92ca001f904965bdd485b03d263f98bf1648d8625d6176148a21cbb0fe11874", "ja": "また食べ物か！　それを言うならダブルミーニング……\nって、そんな大層なもんじゃないだろ！", "zh": "又是吃的啊！那种应该叫双关语（Double meaning）吧……\n不对，哪有那么夸张啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0273_1016_p", "source_sha256": "16c2546e0ff4256770923d83db7b226403be36f525489e1504256a61eab6c6b7", "ja": "はぁ……。まあでも、らしいといえば、らしいのかな。\n遊び心のあるプレゼントっていうか……。", "zh": "唉……不过，要说符合你的风格，倒也确实挺符合的吧。\n该说是充满玩心的礼物……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0273_1017_011ami", "source_sha256": "6b2fea0356dab98215c5c551d7d2bac4d854ea7cc7011e8c3a14a649704d921a", "ja": "んっふっふ～♪　ようやく兄ちゃんも、\n亜美たちのキ・モ・チ♪がわかってきたようだね！", "zh": "嗯哼哼～♪　大哥你好像\n终于明白亚美她们的心·思·啦♪！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0273_1018_011ami", "source_sha256": "21baf9be58d098b716854f28dadf0aaa01906f609c78b04c12099a78986eadbe", "ja": "ってことで兄ちゃんも、カクゴしててね！　これからも\n亜美たち、すんごいイタズラを仕掛けていくから♪", "zh": "所以说，哥哥也要做好心理准备哦！今后\n我们还会继续给你准备超厉害的恶作剧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
